        "3fdacfacffd92f525185": "I want to browse your goods.",
        "871fba304d54eae2be80": "The quest for wealth is the only goal for a respectable goblin.$B$BWell, maybe wealth... and a big, loud death!",
        "a9b31176a3b74b247239": "Train me."
      },
      "name": "Maxwort Uberglint",
